In here, the `pipeline` and `finished` functions should expose custom promisify symbols that return the same version of the function from `streams/promises` such that...

```js
const { pipeline, finished } = require('streams/promises');
const streams = require('streams');
const { promisify } = require('promisify');

assert.strictEqual(pipeline, promisify(streams.pipeline));
assert.strictEqual(finished, promisify(streams.finished));
```
